# Operator secrets, backups and local verification artifacts never leave the host.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/tmp/**
**/temp/**
**/*.dump
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.pgpass
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json

# Local dependencies, build output and tool caches are not deployment sources.
**/.venv/**
**/.uv-cache/**
**/node_modules/**
**/.next/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.cache/**
**/test-results/**
**/playwright-report/**
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
